# Compose rules

- Use Compose v2 modular files under `compose/`; max ~150 lines per file.
- Use profiles for optional services (Plex, socket-proxy).
- Stateful services: `stop_grace_period: 60s`.
- VPN mode: qBittorrent `network_mode: service:gluetun`; publish qBit ports on Gluetun; healthcheck gate.
- Never attach *arr, Seerr, Jellyfin, or Bazarr to Gluetun netns.
- All download/library services mount the same `${DATA_DIR}:/data` parent.
- Early development may use `:latest` (ADR 0010); pin before v0.1.
- `servarr.yml`: Prowlarr, Radarr, Sonarr, Bazarr, Byparr (not FlareSolverr by default).
- `requests.yml`: Seerr with `init: true` (`ghcr.io/seerr-team/seerr`).
- `optimization.yml`: Unpackerr, Recyclarr, Decluttarr, Maintainerr — follow `docs/09-hygiene-defaults.md`.
- Decluttarr qBit URL must be mode-aware (`gluetun` vs `qbittorrent`).
- Do not add Lidarr/Readarr/SABnzbd/Whisper/Autobrr during MVP.
